ADDITIONAL NOTICE ON LAWFUL USE

This software performs active attacks against 802.11 wireless networks
(deauthentication, WPS PIN attempts, association/replay traffic) and recovers
credentials. Running it against networks you do not own, or do not have prior
written authorisation to test, is a criminal offence in most jurisdictions,
including but not limited to the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (US), the
Computer Misuse Act (UK) and §202a-202c StGB (Germany).

The authors and contributors accept no liability for misuse or for damage
caused by this software. You are solely responsible for holding a valid
authorisation covering every network in scope, for respecting the agreed
testing window, and for handling any recovered credentials as confidential
client data.
